//!
//! Wire format:
//!
//! ```text
//! +------------+------------+------------+  (repeated per argument)
//! | <ver/argc> | <length>   | <data>     |
//! | 1 byte     | 4 bytes BE | <len> bytes|
//! +------------+------------+------------+
//! ```
//!
